ter the president got the chair he wanted, what the household numbers say underneath an unemployment rate that looks fine, four things this administration has done that no administration has done before, and the reason the only piece of American crypto policy with a statute underneath it is the one that finances the deficit.</span>\n\n<span>Then the Strategic Bitcoin Reserve, which has never purchased a coin, cannot account for 130,000 of them, and kept the keys in desk drawers.</span>\n\n<span>**500 sats. Nobody is going to hand you this for free, and you shouldn’t want them to.**</span>\n\n⚡ Zap 500 sats to unlock the full article on\nhttps://fanfares.io/naddr/naddr1qvzqqqr4gupzptwpf7366kgg2mwchqypt5m87lq7vu666q8anz5x6qp0h60m2d0pqyvhwumn8ghj7enpdenxzun9wvhxummnw3erztnrdaksqfp3vfskxef5xfjj6vr9vfjz6drzvvez6wf3x33z6dtrxyukgcn9vvcnvdnphfcleu","created_at":1788373954,"id":"f10c407948ca898761240c722e76ef78e6fcc1c34a0bad778aa92543ed76edfa","kind":30023,"pubkey":"adc14fa3ad590856dd8b80815d367f7c1e6735ad00fd98a86d002fbe9fb535e1","sig":"7d651991cf5626d745a0057f7876e05aee9f627fa74900189253d4bca9ce242cf667a0640f312e7240c5e26f6f3afff4f48b50a4c0e394e01f94c824f1e406b6","tags":[["d","1bace42e-0ebd-4bc2-914b-5c19dbec166a"],["encrypted","aes-256-gcm",""],["price","500","SATS"],["referral","100"],["a","31990:d7d8109ee43657ce6056ada4653006bbb641f31e50e85243681c2724507811ec:Fanfares","wss://fanfares.nostr1.com"],["client","Fanfares","31990:d7d8109ee43657ce6056ada4653006bbb641f31e50e85243681c2724507811ec:Fanfares","wss://fanfares.nostr1.com"],["X","c5be075b7e423439593b412a5ac0df37ac5552c47c2ad0853d3fc74eabba5f54","minhash-equality-v1"],["published_at","1788373954"],["title","Ninety Three Days"],["summary","The US government holds 328,000 bitcoin, has never bought one, and stored the keys in desk drawers. That’s the fourth most interesting thing in this piece."],["image","https://api.fanfares.live/cdn/de9fb418375c31630d4e71725c8205a17fbe04b3d1983b829949c0b34159c3cd.png"],["zap","adc14fa